  "author": "Redacción Último Bastión",
  "image": "/images/posts/8984.webp",
  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Se llevó a cabo la tercera Mateada Patrimonial en la sede de la Cooperativa de Pescadores de Carelmapu <img alt=\"🐟\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t21/1/16/1f41f.png\"/><img alt=\"🤝\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t64/1/16/1f91d.png\"/>. La actividad, que busca rescatar historias y vivencias locales para transmitirlas a las nuevas generaciones, fue organizada por la Agrupación Cultural Raíces de Carelmapu y la Oficina de las Culturas y los Pueblos Originarios de la Municipalidad de Maullín.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">El alcalde Nabih Soza Cárdenas destacó el valor histórico y turístico de la iniciativa, acompañado por los concejales Carmen Serón y César Schwarzenberg <img alt=\"👥\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t8b/1/16/1f465.png\"/>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">En la oportunidad, se entregó un reconocimiento especial a cinco destacados dirigentes sociales e históricos de la localidad por su contribución al desarrollo comunitario:</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t3d/1/16/1f3c5.png\"/> José Sergio González González</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t3d/1/16/1f3c5.png\"/> Francisco Ramiro Vera Barría</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t3d/1/16/1f3c5.png\"/> Rosalva Barría</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t3d/1/16/1f3c5.png\"/> Sofía Calixto Barría</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🏅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t3d/1/16/1f3c5.png\"/> Marisa del Carmen Calixto Barría</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fuente comunicaciones munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8985\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/p5hrh7zq8uywxfo/dsc_7076_1024x683_duat1p4o8i.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8986\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/pby198owznic7c1/dsc_7077_2_1024x683_ieqkhl8h9q.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-19 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8989\" data-id=\"8989\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.